{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14882","headline":"早春归盩厔旧居却寄耿拾遗湋李校书端 · 卢纶","name":"早春归盩厔旧居却寄耿拾遗湋李校书端","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野日初晴麦壠分，竹园相接鹿成羣。\n几家废井生青草，一树繁花傍古坟。\n引水忽惊冰满涧，向田空见石和云。\n可怜荒岁青山下，惟有松枝好寄君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}